<div class="kb-item"><b>An application keeps crashing</b><br>Record the application name and any error messages. Restart the application and install approved updates. Avoid installing unapproved or unauthorized software.</div>
<div class="kb-item"><b>How do I install software?</b><br>Download installer from official site, double-click, follow Next → Accept → Install, launch from Start menu.</div>
