<div class="kb-item"><b>Why is my Wi-Fi not working?</b><br>Ensure Wi-Fi is enabled, reconnect to correct network (e.g., NovaTech-Staff), restart device, test another service. If multiple users affected, log a Network/Wi-Fi ticket.</div>
<div class="kb-item"><b>How do I connect to WiFi?</b><br>Open WiFi settings > Select SSID > Enter password > Connect > Test browser.</div>
